OL,3,GNEWSA'Christmas in Antarctica will be
OL,4,Acoolest yet'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn outdoor instructor is preparing to
OL,7,Fswap the familiar landscapes of
OL,8,FShropshire for the icebergs and
OL,9,Fwildlife of Antarctica.
OL,11,FOli Wilde, from Shrewsbury, will leave
OL,12,Fthe UK next week to begin work as an
OL,13,Fexpedition guide, leading visitors on
OL,14,Fkayaking trips and wildlife excursions
OL,15,Facross the Antarctic Peninsula and
OL,16,Fbeyond the Antarctic Circle.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
