OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Christmas in Antarctica will be
OL,4,Acoolest yet'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 14-day expeditions will also see
OL,7,Fhim working over Christmas aboard a
OL,8,Fluxury expedition ship, taking
OL,9,Fpassengers out in smaller boats to
OL,10,Fexplore glaciers, spot whales and
OL,11,Fencounter penguins and seals.
OL,13,F"I've never really seen big mammals
OL,14,Flike the blue whale and humpback
OL,15,Fwhale," he said, adding: "They're just
OL,16,Fhuge. So I think seeing one of those is
OL,17,Fgoing to be pretty incredible."
